---
import ArtifactShelf from './viz/ArtifactShelf.astro';
---
<section class="bg-sectionpaper border-t border-hairline">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-14 py-20">
    <div class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase text-accent mb-4">The gap</div>
    <h2 class="text-[26px] sm:text-[34px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] max-w-[20ch]">Your firm has perfect records — and no memory.</h2>
    <p class="text-[16px] text-bodytext mt-3.5 max-w-[60ch]">Hundreds of IC memos, post-mortems, theses, and letters. Every number preserved; every judgment forgotten. Nothing tells you what you used to believe, when it broke, or who saw it first.</p>
    <div class="mt-10"><ArtifactShelf /></div>
  </div>
</section>
